{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}
{% block title %}{{ booking.reference }} — {{ asset.name }} — {{ site_name }}{% endblock %}
{#
  One booking's file (§6.4, §6.12, §6.15, §6.16).

  Behind RentalAuthorizationService and reached only by a manager of THIS
  asset, which is why it carries everything the public surfaces never do:
  the renter's identity, the internal comments, the full history.

  **Read top to bottom, in four movements.** What the rental is, the one
  thing to do next, where the rental has got to, and then the file itself.
  Everything on the page was already here; what changed is that it no
  longer arrives all at once. The boxes of « Le dossier » are folded, each
  line carrying the figure that answers the question it would have been
  opened for — « 317,50 € dus » saves the click it describes.

  The journey and the checklist are ONE derivation (Booking\BookingJourney
  stages what Booking\BookingMilestones computed), so the five stretches and
  the fifteen lines can never tell different stories. A line still renders
  greyed when it belongs to something this installation cannot do at all (no
  security deposit configured, the stay module off): an unreachable box
  reads as outstanding work.

  **Every panel here is refreshable.** Each region that an action can change
  sits inside an always-present `data-booking-panel` wrapper — always
  present, so a panel that appears or disappears (the option card once the
  booking is final) swaps like any other. public/assets/js/rental-booking.js
  posts the page's forms with fetch and replaces those wrappers' contents
  from a fresh render of this same template, which is what makes pressing
  « Envoyer » tick « Contrat envoyé » without a page load — and what keeps
  the two from ever disagreeing, since there is still exactly one renderer.

  **A box's fold is deliberately OUTSIDE its wrapper.** The `.collapse` and
  the button that toggles it belong to the card; only the body and the
  figure are swapped. Cashing a payment therefore leaves the Paiements box
  open at the line you were reading, where re-rendering the card around it
  would have folded the box under your hands. The journey's own stretches
  are the exception and it is the right one: an action that moves the
  booking on moves which stretch is current, and the fresh render opening
  the new one is the answer, not a lost place.
#}
{% block content %}
    <div class="page-medium" data-rental-booking>
        {% include 'partials/page_header.html.twig' with {
            title: booking.reference,
            subtitle: asset.name ~ ' · du ' ~ booking.arrivalDate|date_fr ~ ' au ' ~ booking.departureDate|date_fr,
        } only %}
        <div data-booking-panel="in-progress">
            {% if is_in_progress %}
                <p class="mb-3">{% include 'partials/status_badge.html.twig' with { status: 'active', label: 'En cours' } only %}</p>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        {% include '@rental/management/_nav.html.twig' %}

        {# ── 1. Les détails de la location ─────────────────────────── #}
        {#
          Who, what, when, how much — and the status, which used to have a
          card of its own two screens down. Two cards answering « où en est
          cette réservation ? » differently is precisely what this page was
          reorganised to stop.
        #}
        <div data-booking-panel="renter">
        <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Les détails de la location</h2>
                <dl class="row mb-0">
                    <dt class="col-sm-4">Locataire</dt>
                    <dd class="col-sm-8">{{ booking.renterName }}</dd>
                    <dt class="col-sm-4">Email</dt>
                    <dd class="col-sm-8"><a href="mailto:{{ booking.renterEmail }}">{{ booking.renterEmail }}</a></dd>
                    {% if booking.renterPhone %}
                        <dt class="col-sm-4">Téléphone</dt>
                        <dd class="col-sm-8"><a href="tel:{{ booking.renterPhone|replace({' ': ''}) }}">{{ booking.renterPhone }}</a></dd>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if booking.renterOrganisation %}
                        <dt class="col-sm-4">Organisation</dt>
                        <dd class="col-sm-8">{{ booking.renterOrganisation }}</dd>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if booking.purpose %}
                        <dt class="col-sm-4">Objet</dt>
                        <dd class="col-sm-8">{{ booking.purpose }}</dd>
                    {% endif %}
                    <dt class="col-sm-4">Dates</dt>
                    <dd class="col-sm-8">
                        du {{ booking.arrivalDate|date_fr }} au {{ booking.departureDate|date_fr }}
                    </dd>
                    {% if booking.estimatedPersons %}
                        <dt class="col-sm-4">Participants annoncés</dt>
                        <dd class="col-sm-8">{{ booking.estimatedPersons }}</dd>
                    {% endif %}
                    <dt class="col-sm-4">Total</dt>
                    <dd class="col-sm-8">
                        {{ quote.totalCents|money_cents }}
                        {% if payment.available and payment.enabled %}
                            <span class="text-body-secondary small d-block">
                                {{ payment.received_cents|money_cents }} reçus
                                {%- if payment.remaining_cents > 0 %}, {{ payment.remaining_cents|money_cents }} dus{% endif %}
                            </span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </dd>
                    <dt class="col-sm-4">Statut</dt>
                    <dd class="col-sm-8">{% include '@rental/_status_badge.html.twig' with { status: booking.status } only %}</dd>
                    {% if booking.renterComment %}
                        <dt class="col-sm-4">Message</dt>
                        <dd class="col-sm-8">{{ booking.renterComment|nl2br }}</dd>
                    {% endif %}
                </dl>

                {# Le lien de suivi ne s'affiche nulle part : sa possession
                   EST l'autorisation (§8.52). Il ne se récupère donc pas —
                   il se remplace, et le nouveau part par email au locataire. #}
                <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/lien-suivi" class="mt-3"
                      data-confirm="Régénérer le lien ? L'ancien cessera de fonctionner et le locataire devra recevoir le nouveau.">
                    {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                    <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">
                        Régénérer le lien de suivi
                    </button>
                    <div class="form-text">
                        À faire si le locataire a perdu son lien, ou l'a transmis à quelqu'un
                        qui ne devait pas le recevoir. Le nouveau lien lui est envoyé par email.
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>

        {# ── 2. L'action suivante ──────────────────────────────────── #}
        {#
          One card, the first applicable milestone that is not done, and its
          way in. Nothing else — a second suggestion here would put the
          manager back to choosing, which is the job this card exists to do
          for them.

          Its button is a LINK to the box where the thing is settled, except
          for the milestones whose button is a status transition: those are
          rendered here in full, because sending somebody to a phase to
          press « Confirmée » when the button could be under their thumb is
          a link pretending to be an action.
        #}
        <div data-booking-panel="next-step">
        <div class="card border-primary mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="h5 mb-2">L'action suivante</h2>
                {% if journey.next %}
                    <p class="mb-2">
                        <span class="fw-semibold">{{ journey.next.label }}</span>
                        {% if journey.next.detail %}
                            <span class="text-body-secondary small d-block">{{ journey.next.detail }}</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </p>
                    {% if journey.liftedTransitions is not empty %}
                        {% include '@rental/management/_transitions.html.twig' with {
                            asset: asset, booking: booking,
                            transitions: journey.liftedTransitions, renter_decisions: renter_decisions,
                        } only %}
                    {% elseif journey.nextBox %}
                        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#{{ journey.nextBox.anchor }}">
                            Ouvrir « {{ journey.nextBox.label }} »
                        </a>
                    {% else %}
                        <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-0">
                            Rien à presser ici : cette étape se règle plus bas, dans « Où en est cette location ».
                        </p>
                    {% endif %}
                {% elseif booking.status.isFinal %}
                    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">
                        Cette réservation est dans un état définitif : elle ne peut plus changer.
                        Une nouvelle demande est nécessaire.
                    </p>
                {% else %}
                    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">
                        Rien n'attend de vous sur cette location.
                    </p>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>

        {# ── 3. Où en est cette location ───────────────────────────── #}
        {#
          The fifteen milestones in five stretches, the current one open.
          Fifteen ticked boxes in a column are a list; five named stretches
          with one of them open are a position.

          A stretch's own decisions live inside it: the status buttons
          Booking\BookingPhase::ofTransition() files there, and the option
          form, which is how « La demande » holds its dates. The « État »
          card that used to carry all of them is gone — its badge is in the
          details above, and its buttons were never a state.
        #}
        <div data-booking-panel="milestones">
        <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Où en est cette location</h2>
                {% for phase in journey.phases %}
                    {% set phase_id = 'phase-' ~ phase.key %}
                    <div class="border-bottom">
                        <h3 class="mb-0">
                            <button type="button"
                                    class="btn w-100 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 px-0 py-2 text-start{{ phase.isCurrent ? '' : ' collapsed' }}"
                                    data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#{{ phase_id }}"
                                    aria-expanded="{{ phase.isCurrent ? 'true' : 'false' }}" aria-controls="{{ phase_id }}">
                                <span class="fw-semibold flex-grow-1">{{ phase.label }}</span>
                                <span class="text-body-secondary small">{{ phase.summary }}</span>
                                {% if phase.transitions is not empty %}
                                    <span class="badge text-bg-secondary">
                                        {{ phase.transitions|length }} décision{{ phase.transitions|length > 1 ? 's' : '' }}
                                    </span>
                                {% endif %}
                                <i class="bi bi-chevron-down text-body-tertiary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <div class="collapse{{ phase.isCurrent ? ' show' }}" id="{{ phase_id }}">
                            <div class="pb-3">
                                <p class="text-body-secondary small">{{ phase.description }}</p>
                                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                                    {% for milestone in phase.milestones %}
                                        <li class="mb-1 {{ milestone.isApplicable ? '' : 'text-body-secondary opacity-50' }}">
                                            {% if not milestone.isApplicable %}
                                                <i class="bi bi-dash-square" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                <span class="visually-hidden">Sans objet :</span>
                                            {% elseif milestone.isDone %}
                                                <i class="bi bi-check-square" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                <span class="visually-hidden">Fait :</span>
                                            {% else %}
                                                <i class="bi bi-square" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                <span class="visually-hidden">À faire :</span>
                                            {% endif %}
                                            {{ milestone.label }}
                                            {% if milestone.detail %}
                                                <span class="text-body-secondary small">— {{ milestone.detail }}</span>
                                            {% endif %}
                                        </li>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </ul>

                                {% if phase.transitions is not empty %}
                                    <div class="mt-3">
                                        {% include '@rental/management/_transitions.html.twig' with {
                                            asset: asset, booking: booking,
                                            transitions: phase.transitions, renter_decisions: renter_decisions,
                                        } only %}
                                    </div>
                                {% endif %}

                                {% if phase.key == 'request' %}
                                    {# The option lives with the request it holds the dates for. #}
                                    <div data-booking-panel="hold">
                                    {% if not booking.status.isFinal %}
                                        <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/option" class="row g-2 align-items-end mt-3">
                                            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                                            <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                                            <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-7">
                                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                                    field_id: 'option-until', field_name: 'until', type: 'datetime-local',
                                                    label: 'Option jusqu\'au',
                                                    value: booking.holdUntil ? booking.holdUntil|date('Y-m-d\\TH:i') : '',
                                                } only %}
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-5">
                                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-secondary w-100">Enregistrer l'option</button>
                                            </div>
                                            {# Under the row, not under the field — see
                                               design.md §7.6: `align-items-end` aligns the
                                               bottoms of the columns, not their controls. #}
                                            <p class="form-text col-12 mb-0">
                                                Une option engage l'unité jusqu'à l'échéance : si elle passe sans
                                                confirmation, la réservation devient expirée et les dates se libèrent.
                                                Laisser vide et enregistrer lève le blocage.
                                            </p>
                                        </form>
                                    {% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                {% endif %}

                                {% if phase.box %}
                                    <p class="mb-0 mt-3">
                                        <a href="#{{ phase.box.anchor }}">Voir « {{ phase.box.label }} »</a>
                                    </p>
                                {% endif %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>

        {# ── 4. Le dossier ─────────────────────────────────────────── #}
        {#
          The boxes, folded. `public/assets/js/collapse-anchor.js` opens the
          one a fragment names, which is what makes the journey's « Voir
          "Paiements" » a working link rather than a scroll to a closed card.
        #}
        <h2 class="h5 mb-2">Le dossier</h2>
        <p class="text-body-secondary small">
            Tout ce que la location a produit. Chaque boîte s'ouvre d'un clic ; le chiffre
            à côté de son nom dit ce qu'elle contient.
        </p>

        <div class="card mb-3" id="{{ boxes.prix.anchor }}">
            {% embed '@rental/management/_dossier_header.html.twig' with {
                box: boxes.prix, target_id: 'box-prix',
            } only %}
                {% block figure %}
                    <span class="text-body-secondary small" data-booking-panel="price-figure">
                        {{ quote.totalCents|money_cents }}
                    </span>
                {% endblock %}
            {% endembed %}
            <div class="collapse" id="box-prix">
                <div data-booking-panel="price">
                    {% include '@rental/management/_price.html.twig' %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-3" id="{{ boxes.paiements.anchor }}">
            {% embed '@rental/management/_dossier_header.html.twig' with {
                box: boxes.paiements, target_id: 'box-paiements',
            } only %}
                {% block figure %}
                    <span class="text-body-secondary small" data-booking-panel="payment-figure">
                        {% if not payment.available %}
                            Suivi hors ScoutMagic
                        {% elseif not payment.enabled %}
                            Non activés
                        {% elseif payment.remaining_cents > 0 %}
                            {{ payment.remaining_cents|money_cents }} dus
                        {% else %}
                            Soldé
                        {% endif %}
                    </span>
                {% endblock %}
            {% endembed %}
            <div class="collapse" id="box-paiements">
                <div data-booking-panel="payment">
                    {% include '@rental/management/_payment.html.twig' %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-3" id="{{ boxes.documents.anchor }}">
            {% embed '@rental/management/_dossier_header.html.twig' with {
                box: boxes.documents, target_id: 'box-documents',
            } only %}
                {% block figure %}
                    <span class="text-body-secondary small" data-booking-panel="documents-figure">
                        {{ documents is empty
                            ? 'Aucun document'
                            : documents|length ~ ' document' ~ (documents|length > 1 ? 's' : '') }}
                    </span>
                {% endblock %}
            {% endembed %}
            <div class="collapse" id="box-documents">
                <div data-booking-panel="documents">
                    {% include '@rental/management/_documents.html.twig' %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {#
          Courrier is the one box that is not always there. Unlike every
          other region on this page, what decides it — `inbound_mail`
          enabled, a mailbox configured — is not something a button here can
          change, so its presence is fixed for the life of the page and the
          refresh never has to match a wrapper against a card that has come
          or gone. A box that could only ever be empty is noise (§7.7).
        #}
        {% if communications_available %}
            <div class="card mb-3" id="{{ boxes.courrier.anchor }}">
                {% embed '@rental/management/_dossier_header.html.twig' with {
                    box: boxes.courrier, target_id: 'box-courrier',
                } only %}
                    {% block figure %}
                        <span class="text-body-secondary small" data-booking-panel="communications-figure">
                            {{ messages is empty
                                ? 'Aucun message'
                                : messages|length ~ ' message' ~ (messages|length > 1 ? 's' : '') }}
                        </span>
                    {% endblock %}
                {% endembed %}
                <div class="collapse" id="box-courrier">
                    <div data-booking-panel="communications">
                        {% include '@rental/management/_communications.html.twig' %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% set pending_changes = change_requests|filter(c => c.isPending)|length %}
        <div class="card mb-3" id="{{ boxes.demandes.anchor }}">
            {% embed '@rental/management/_dossier_header.html.twig' with {
                box: boxes.demandes, target_id: 'box-demandes',
            } only %}
                {% block figure %}
                    <span class="text-body-secondary small" data-booking-panel="changes-figure">
                        {% if pending_changes > 0 %}
                            <span class="badge text-bg-warning">{{ pending_changes }} en attente</span>
                        {% elseif change_requests is empty %}
                            Aucune demande
                        {% else %}
                            {{ change_requests|length }} demande{{ change_requests|length > 1 ? 's' : '' }}
                        {% endif %}
                    </span>
                {% endblock %}
            {% endembed %}
            <div class="collapse" id="box-demandes">
                <div data-booking-panel="changes">
                    {% include '@rental/management/_changes.html.twig' %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {#
          The stay is a page of its own, so its line is a link rather than a
          fold — the only one in the list, and it says so by carrying an
          arrow instead of a chevron.
        #}
        <div class="card mb-3" id="{{ boxes.sejour.anchor }}">
            <a class="card-body d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 text-decoration-none"
               href="/mes-locations/{{ asset.slug }}/reservations/{{ booking.id }}/sejour">
                <span>
                    <span class="h6 mb-0">{{ boxes.sejour.label }}</span>
                    <span class="text-body-secondary small d-block">
                        Relevés de compteurs, état des lieux, incidents et décompte final.
                    </span>
                </span>
                <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right text-body-tertiary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-3" id="{{ boxes.commentaires.anchor }}">
            {% embed '@rental/management/_dossier_header.html.twig' with {
                box: boxes.commentaires, target_id: 'box-commentaires',
            } only %}
                {% block figure %}
                    <span class="text-body-secondary small" data-booking-panel="comments-figure">
                        {{ comments is empty
                            ? 'Aucun commentaire'
                            : comments|length ~ ' commentaire' ~ (comments|length > 1 ? 's' : '') }}
                    </span>
                {% endblock %}
            {% endembed %}
            <div class="collapse" id="box-commentaires">
                <div data-booking-panel="comments">
                    {% include '@rental/management/_comments.html.twig' %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-3" id="{{ boxes.historique.anchor }}">
            {% embed '@rental/management/_dossier_header.html.twig' with {
                box: boxes.historique, target_id: 'box-historique',
            } only %}
                {% block figure %}
                    <span class="text-body-secondary small" data-booking-panel="history-figure">
                        {{ audit_page.total }} modification{{ audit_page.total > 1 ? 's' : '' }}
                    </span>
                {% endblock %}
            {% endembed %}
            <div class="collapse" id="box-historique">
                <div data-booking-panel="history">
                    <div class="card-body pt-0">
                        {% include 'partials/audit_timeline.html.twig' with {
                            entity_type: 'rental_booking',
                            entity_id: booking.id,
                            audit_page: audit_page,
                            labels: audit_labels,
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
    {# Turns every form above into a fetch, then re-renders the panels. #}
    <script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/rental-booking.js') }}" defer></script>
    {# Opens the box a fragment names — « Voir "Paiements" » above, and any
       link sent from elsewhere into this page. #}
    <script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/collapse-anchor.js') }}" defer></script>
    <script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/drop-zone.js') }}" defer></script>
    {# Names the file that was picked: the zone's input is visually hidden,
       so a zone that says nothing looks the same before and after a drop. #}
    <script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/upload-drop-zone.js') }}" defer></script>
{% endblock %}
